    4112	**Why this section exists:** S87 (Gowers `U^k` of χ_P), S88 (Anderson
    4113	Lyapunov of χ_P-Schrödinger), and S89 (parity-calibrated depth-2
    4114	threshold circuits) jointly established a triple confirmation that
    4115	**every detectable deviation of χ_P from random is exactly the Hardy-
    4116	Littlewood singular series mod q, fully removed by the Green-Tao
    4117	W-trick**. The additive / spectral / circuit-complexity regime on the
    4118	*bare prime indicator* is now a closed family. Future productive
    4119	attacks must move to the **multiplicative regime**: Liouville `λ(n)`,
    4120	Möbius `μ(n)`, von Mangoldt `Λ(n)` truncated, etc. These are predicted
    4121	to be Gowers-uniform *without* W-tricking (Green-Tao 2012 Möbius/
    4122	nilsequence orthogonality theorem). Any deviation found here is fresh
    4123	territory the W-trick framework cannot explain.
